# Option combinations: symmetry, weights, endpoints, naming, fma, real.
approx sin(x) in -1..1 degree 5 keep endpoints nosym as f32 list 1
approx sin(x) in 0..1 degree 3 weight 1/(1+x*x) as f32 list 1
approx exp(x) in 0..1 degree 4 as f32 name myap list 1
approx sin(x) in 0..1 degree 3 at 0.5 as f32 list 1
approx exp(x) in 0..1 as real degree 4 list 2
approx exp(x) in 0..1 ulp 2 as f32 list 1
